X-SOURCE:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond
UID:event_316660379@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045558Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T140000
SUMMARY:Jenner - Beginners paddle
DESCRIPTION:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond\nHello All\n\nLets get out on 
 the water and have some fun.\nIf anyone wants to practice some rescues and
  / or some rolls we can do that at the beginning of the paddle.\nWe will m
 eet at the boat ramp by the Jenner Visitor Center.\n\nCall Brent for Kayak
  Rental information\n707 867 8166\n\n**Schedule**\n***9:00*** am - meet at
  the boat ramp.\nUnload kayaks and get ready for the paddle. Please arrive
  as early as needed to set up your kayak.\n***9:30am*** \\- safety meeting
  and OTW \\(on the water\\)\n***200pm*** \\- approximate return time to bo
 at ramp\n\n**Skill Level**\nAll skill levels welcome\n\n**Boat Types allow
 ed**\nAll kayaks\, canoes\, and SUPS are welcome\n\n**What to Bring**\nKay
 ak\nPaddle\nPFD - must be worn while we are on the water.\nwarm clothes in
  your kayak and in your car\n**snacks to share** \\- we will be stopping a
 t a beach to have drinks and snacks and lunch\\.\nLunch\nWater\n\n**Parkin
 g / Launch Fee**\nParking and launch fee are free.\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n**PLEAS
 E READ THIS**: The organizers of this trip are not experts\, not professio
 nal paddlers and do not necessarily have safety training or carry any safe
 ty equipment. Each paddler must have the training\, experience and equipme
 nt required to complete this paddle safely\, and must assume all personal 
 risks and liabilities.\nYou are responsible and liable for any and all thi
 ngs that you do. If you are bringing a guest you are responsible for them 
 and their actions as well. You are also responsible and liable for all you
 r gear and any gear that your guest brings.\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Questions or Conce
 rns**\nPlease call\nBrent Swinth\n707 867 8166
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/kayaking-sonoma-beyond/events/3166603
 79/
