BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond
UID:event_316660253@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045558Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
SUMMARY:Richardson Bay
DESCRIPTION:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond\n**DESCRIPTION**\nLets go enjo
 y Richardson Bay.\nWe will meet at Schoonmaker Beach.\nThis is a nice sand
 y beach. A problem is that parking is a considerable ways away.\nAn altern
 ative launch site will be Dunphy Park.\nParking is closer and there is a d
 ock and a beach to launch from.\nI will finalize the launch location as we
  get closer to the event date.\nFrom our launch site we will head out the 
 bay towards downtown Sausalito and beyond.\n\n**LAUNCH SITES**\n**Schoonma
 ker beach in Sausalito also known as Sausalito Beach.**\nInfo to come\n\n*
 *Dunphy Park**\nInfo to come\n\n**PARKING**\n**Schoonmaker beach**\nParkin
 g will be at the bay model parking lot.\nParking is free and there is usua
 lly plenty of places to park.\n\n**Dunphy Park**\nInfo to come\n\n**Skills
  Sheet**\n[North Bay Kayakers - Skill Sheet](https://drive.google.com/file
 /d/1eeMvKc4JCaJz7K4DaNpS567tyUT5IUGc/view?usp=sharing)\n\n**LIABILITY RELE
 ASE**\nPlease fill out and bring the signed hard copy to the event.\n**DO 
 NOT** email me a copy of the liability release form. I need to have the ha
 rd copy at the event.\n[LIABILITY RELEASE](https://drive.google.com/file/d
 /1Guu1nO73vW9cjalZeXK90zO5eONk-xs9/view?usp=sharing)\n\n**BOAT REQUIREMENT
 S**\nNo inflatables\, or folding Kayaks\nSUP's Please call me to discuss.\
 nSit on Top and Closed Deck kayaks are best for this event.\n\n**SCHEDULE*
 *\n9:30 am meet on the beach.\n10:00am Pre paddle meeting and OTW (on the 
 water)\nIf you need more time to set up your boat\, please arrive earlier.
 \nWe will be on the water (OTW) on time.\n4:00pm ***approximate*** return 
 time to the beach.\n\n**WHAT TO BRING**\nKayak\, Paddle\nPFD (must be worn
  while we are on the water)\nWater\, Lunch\, Snacks\nVHF radio if you have
  one\nDry change of clothes in a dry bag in your boat.\nDry change of clot
 hes in your car for after the paddle.\npaddle float\nbilge pump\nspray ski
 rt\nWet suit or dry suit\n*Call me if you need any of the above items.*\n\
 n**REMINDERS**\nYou can never have to many layers to put on when you get c
 old.\n\n**QUESTIONS OR CONCERNS**\nPlease contact me.\nBrent Swinth\n707 8
 67 8166\n\n***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* IMPORTANT PLEASE REA
 D \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\nIn RSVP'ing for this ev
 ent you are declaring that the organizer\, event hosts\, and leaders of No
 rth Bay Kayakers are not responsible and/or liable for anything that happe
 ns to you or your gear. YOU are responsible and Liable for your own safety
  and the safety of your gear. If you are bringing a guest then you are tak
 ing full responsibility and liability for them and their gear and anything
  that they do.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/kayaking-sonoma-beyond/events/3166602
 53/
